        "text_TB8x7G": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>NADCO foil tapes are highly malleable and conform easily to uneven or irregular surfaces. Their strength and versatility make them well suited for applications requiring sealing, masking, or environmental resistance.</p><p>Foil tapes perform exceptionally well in conditions involving <strong>heat, moisture, and harsh environments</strong>.</p><p><strong>Common uses:</strong> HVAC systems, aerospace, automotive, industrial sealing, and long-term durability applications.</p>",
