        "text_8wbcxK": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our posters are printed on bright white, scratch- and water-resistant paper designed for both indoor and outdoor durability. This material provides excellent image quality while maintaining strength and longevity.</p><p><strong>Common uses:</strong> billboards, construction signage, outdoor displays, advertising, and promotional materials.</p>",
