          }
        },
        "text_eGahEx": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>From specialty materials to custom graphics and signage, NADCO delivers solutions that go beyond standard pressure-sensitive products. Our in-house manufacturing capabilities allow us to customize materials, formats, and finishes to meet your exact requirements.</p><p><strong>Contact us</strong> to learn more about these products or explore how NADCO can support your next project.</p>",
